## 7. Guardrails

- The deletion is irreversible except for trash recovery; confirm the target ID.
- Never delete scratch files folder-wide; remove only the inventoried files.
- Never resurrect a deleted session's logs; review them before deletion if needed.
- macOS retirement uses `trash`, never `rm`.

